": 251.02, "text": "He is getting it.", "end": 252.02}, {"start": 252.02, "text": "He is getting his hat.", "end": 255.02}, {"start": 255.02, "text": "The man's hat.", "end": 256.02}, {"start": 256.02, "text": "帮你们复习一下。", "end": 257.02}, {"start": 257.02, "text": "Did he get it?", "end": 259.02}, {"start": 259.02, "text": "Did he get it?", "end": 260.02}, {"start": 260.02, "text": "Yes, he has it.", "end": 262.02}, {"start": 262.02, "text": "你们有没有发现问句的比例大大提高了?", "end": 264.02}, {"start": 264.02, "text": "所以我们还是要回归到一些问句的首词去定义一些问句。", "end": 268.02}, {"start": 268.02, "text": "我们说do,do的过去是什么?", "end": 271.02}, {"start": 271.02, "text": "不是,did, right?", "end": 273.02}, {"start": 273.02, "text": "Did he get it?", "end": 274.02}, {"start": 274.02, "text": "做了吗?", "end": 275.02}, {"start": 275.02, "text": "他拿这件事情。", "end": 277.02}, {"start": 277.02, "text": "所以做了吗?", "end": 279.02}, {"start": 279.02, "text": "Did就定义了问题是什么?", "end": 281.74}, {"start": 281.74, "text": "是否完成了一个事情。", "end": 284.17}, {"start": 284.17, "text": "Did he get it?", "end": 285.17}, {"start": 285.17, "text": "你们要开始用问题的思维去问问题了。", "end": 288.17}, {"start": 288.17, "text": "包括他的语序,你们也要搞清楚了。", "end": 291.17}, {"start": 291.17, "text": "Did he get it?", "end": 292.17}, {"start": 292.17, "text": "Yes, he has it.", "end": 294.73}, {"start": 294.73, "text": "为什么不是he have it?", "end": 298.06}, {"start": 298.06, "text": "He, she, it。", "end": 300.06}, {"start": 300.06, "text": "第三人称的个体,我们都要干嘛?", "end": 303.06}, {"start": 303.06, "text": "做一个模糊尾音处理。", "end": 305.06}, {"start": 305.06, "text": "He has it.", "end": 306.62}, {"start": 306.62, "text": "He went out of the room.", "end": 308.62}, {"start": 308.62, "text": "He go out of the room?", "end": 310.62}, {"start": 310.62, "text": "很多人会这样讲话,对吧?", "end": 312.62}, {"start": 312.62, "text": "你的动词如果没有任何的明确时态,", "end": 315.62}, {"start": 315.62, "text": "听的人不清楚到底是走了没走。", "end": 318.62}, {"start": 318.62, "text": "所以我们永远永远要注意这个问题。", "end": 320.62}, {"start": 320.62, "text": "但凡是有人完成的动作,", "end": 322.62}, {"start": 322.62, "text": "或者正在做的事,", "end": 324.62}, {"start": 324.62, "text": "或者打算做的事,你要明确。", "end": 326.62}, {"start": 326.62, "text": "这里说he went out of the room。", "end": 329.62}, {"start": 329.62, "text": "说明什么?Mr. Smith已经不在了。", "end": 332.62}, {"start": 332.62, "text": "Out of the room这件事,他已经完成了。", "end": 335.62}, {"start": 335.62, "text": "He went out of the room.", "end": 337.62}, {"start": 337.62, "text": "Went是什么?", "end": 338.62}, {"start": 338.62, "text": "Go的过去式。", "end": 339.62}, {"start": 339.62, "text": "注意一些老动词,我讲老动词。", "end": 343.5}, {"start": 343.5, "text": "有人说强弱动词。", "end": 344.5}, {"start": 344.5, "text": "其他语言来的一些习惯,保留在英语里。", "end": 347.5}, {"start": 347.5, "text": "所以他们看着怪怪的。", "end": 349.5}, {"start": 349.5, "text": "你多用几遍就会了。", "end": 351.5}, {"start": 351.5, "text": "He went out of the room.", "end": 353.5}, {"start": 353.5, "text": "Went out of。", "end": 354.5}, {"start": 354.5, "text": "注意out of。", "end": 356.5}, {"start": 356.5, "text": "这个语言习惯有保留。", "end": 358.5}, {"start": 358.5, "text": "能不能不说of?", "end": 359.5}, {"start": 359.5, "text": "He went out the room。", "end": 360.5}, {"start": 360.5, "text": "现在的美式英语里面确实是可以省略。", "end": 363.5}, {"start": 363.5, "text": "When he saw the hat, he took it off the hook。", "end": 366.5}, {"start": 366.5, "text": "我们现在在描述一些已经完成的事情。", "end": 369.5}, {"start": 369.5, "text": "像是回顾。", "end": 371.5}, {"start": 371.5, "text": "你看到虚线。", "end": 372.5}, {"start": 372.5, "text": "我们在回顾刚刚Smith做了什么事情。", "end": 375.5}, {"start": 375.5, "text": "When?", "end": 376.5}, {"start": 376.5, "text": "What time?", "end": 378.22}, {"start": 378.22, "text": "When?", "end": 379.22}, {"start": 379.22, "text": "问任何时间都说when。", "end": 381.97}, {"start": 381.97, "text": "能不能说what time?", "end": 383.97}, {"start": 383.97, "text": "也行。", "end": 384.97}, {"start": 384.97, "text": "When he saw the hat, he took it off the hook。", "end": 389.76}, {"start": 389.76, "text": "这整个词都完成了。", "end"