start": 1078.87, "text": "首饰怎么讲?jewelry。", "end": 1081.3}, {"start": 1081.3, "text": "所以他在一个首饰店。", "end": 1083.3}, {"start": 1086.3, "text": "大一点的叫store。", "end": 1087.3}, {"start": 1087.3, "text": "仓储。", "end": 1088.3}, {"start": 1088.3, "text": "或者提发店。", "end": 1089.3}, {"start": 1089.3, "text": "小一点叫shop。", "end": 1090.3}, {"start": 1094.86, "text": "想要干嘛?", "end": 1095.86}, {"start": 1100.26, "text": "项链怎么说?", "end": 1101.26}, {"start": 1103.72, "text": "学过的词。", "end": 1104.72}, {"start": 1109.31, "text": "想要干嘛?", "end": 1110.31}, {"start": 1117.84, "text": "女朋友。", "end": 1119.59}, {"start": 1119.09, "text": "女朋友。", "end": 1121.09}, {"start": 1131.8, "text": "这种盒叫什么?", "end": 1134.49}, {"start": 1136.49, "text": "礼物盒。", "end": 1137.49}, {"start": 1147.49, "text": "让她惊喜。", "end": 1148.49}, {"start": 1149.49, "text": "我们之前有接触过一次这个词。", "end": 1152.02}, {"start": 1153.02, "text": "你去看任何的美剧啊。", "end": 1155.02}, {"start": 1155.02, "text": "包括生日宴。", "end": 1156.02}, {"start": 1157.02, "text": "就是这个。", "end": 1158.02}, {"start": 1163.02, "text": "看起来。", "end": 1164.02}, {"start": 1169.02, "text": "在爱情中。", "end": 1170.02}, {"start": 1171.02, "text": "当然你也可以描述房间这个环境。", "end": 1173.02}, {"start": 1177.02, "text": "这基本都是学过的一些基础句式啊。", "end": 1180.02}, {"start": 1180.02, "text": "那当然有一些编辑的单词你还不完全懂。", "end": 1183.02}, {"start": 1183.02, "text": "没有关系。", "end": 1184.02}, {"start": 1184.02, "text": "你要能把简单的谁在干什么。", "end": 1186.02}, {"start": 1186.02, "text": "在哪里。", "end": 1187.02}, {"start": 1187.02, "text": "这些说清楚就好了。", "end": 1189.02}, {"start": 1189.02, "text": "如果你偶尔遇到一两个不会说的词。", "end": 1191.02}, {"start": 1191.02, "text": "现场查一下就好了。", "end": 1193.02}, {"start": 1193.02, "text": "用几遍就想起来了。", "end": 1195.02}, {"start": 1195.02, "text": "瑞杰老师对一些比较低频的英语单词。", "end": 1198.02}, {"start": 1198.02, "text": "或者什么生僻词的建议是怎样。", "end": 1200.02}, {"start": 1200.02, "text": "不要专门去记。", "end": 1202.02}, {"start": 1202.02, "text": "你需要的时候用一次。", "end": 1204.02}, {"start": 1204.02, "text": "需要的时候用一次。", "end": 1205.02}, {"start": 1205.02, "text": "差不多三四次。", "end": 1206.02}, {"start": 1206.02, "text": "你就一辈子都会说了。", "end": 1208.02}, {"start": 1208.02, "text": "我们只要把精力放在这些核心上面。", "end": 1211.02}, {"start": 1211.02, "text": "那我们看一下啊。", "end": 1212.64}, {"start": 1212.64, "text": "一个完整版的书写。", "end": 1214.64}, {"start": 1214.64, "text": "在这里也把书写阅读。", "end": 1216.64}, {"start": 1216.64, "text": "练习一下。", "end": 1217.64}, {"start": 1218.64, "text": "一般夜间我们说PM。", "end": 1220.64}, {"start": 1220.64, "text": "曾间我们说AM。", "end": 1222.64}, {"start": 1222.64, "text": "And the man is getting ready to finish work.", "end": 1227.33}, {"start": 1227.33, "text": "He is getting ready.", "end": 1229.33}, {"start": 1229.33, "text": "目的是什么?", "end": 1230.33}, {"start": 1230.33, "text": "To finish work.", "end": 1232.33}, {"start": 1232.33, "text": "Work 工作。", "end": 1234.21}, {"start": 1234.21, "text": "Today is Valentine's Day.", "end": 1237.21}, {"start": 1237.21, "text": "Valentine's Day。", "end": 1239.21}, {"start": 1239.21, "text": "西方的2月14号是Valentine's Day。", "end": 1243.21}, {"start": 1243.21, "text": "中国也有相应的节日。", "end": 1246.21}, {"start": 1246.21, "text": "And the streets are filled with a romantic atmosphere.", "end": 1252.25}, {"start": 1252.25, "text": "这句作为一个延伸来学。", "end": 1254.25}, {"start": 1254.25, "text": "And the streets.", "end": 1256.25}, {"start": 1256.25, "text": "Streets我们学过对吧。", "end": 1258.25}, {"start": 1258.25, "text": "A road.", "end": 1259.25}, {"start": 1259.25, "text": "If a road is small, it's a street.", "end": 1262.25}, {"start": 1262.25, "text": "If a road is big, avenue.", "end": 1264.25}, {"start": 1264.25, "text": "所以它这是Street。", "end": 1265.97}, {"start": 1265.97, "text": "小街。", "end": 1266.97}, {"start": 1266.97, "text": "And the streets are filled with a romantic atmosphere.", "end": 1271.97}, {"start": 1271.97, "text": "罗曼蒂克已经翻译成汉语。", "end": 1273.97}, {"start": 1273.97, "text": "汉语也有罗曼蒂克的说法。", "end": 1276.97}, {"start": 1276.97, "text": "Atmosphere。", "end": 1277.97}, {"start": 1277.97, "text": "气氛。", "end": 1278.97}, {"start": 1278.97, "text": "氛围。", "end": 1279.97}, {"start": 1279.97, "text": "The streets are filled with a romantic atmosphere.", "end": 1281.97}, {"start": 1281.97, "text": "He goes to a jewelry store to pick out a piece of jewelry for his wife.", "end": 1286.97}, {"start": 1286.97, "text": "He likes a necklace.", "end": 1288.97}, {"start": 1288.97, "text": "He goes to a jewelry store to pick out a piece of jewelry for his wife.", "end": 1293.97}, {"start": 1293.97, "text": "刚刚说的。", "end": 1294.97}, {"start": 1294.97, "text": "首饰怎么讲。", "end": 1295.97}, {"start": 1295.97, "text": "Jewelry, right?", "end": 1296.97}, {"start": 1296.97, "text": "For his wife.", "end": 1297.97}, {"start": 1297.97, "text": "He likes a necklace very much.", "end": 1300.97}, {"start": 1300.97, "text": "He likes a necklace very much.", "end": 1303.97}, {"start": 1303.97, "text": "他看上来。", "end": 1304.97}, {"start": 1304.97, "text": "喜欢。", "end": 1305.97}, {"start": 1305.97, "text": "Imagining。", "end": 1307.97}, {"start": 1307.97, "text": "这个词是什么意思?", "end": 1308.97}, {"start": 1308.97, "text": "我们想象一件事叫imagining。", "end": 1311.63}, {"start": 1311.63, "text": "这词怎么来的呢?", "end": 1312.63}, {"start": 1312.63, "text": "Image就是画面。", "end": 1314.63}, {"start": 1314.63, "text": "所以我们在脑中形成画面的英语就叫imagining。", "end": 1317.63}, {"start": 1317.63, "text": "它从image这个词来的。", "end": 1319.63}, {"start": 1319.63, "text": "Imagining, the big hug his wife will give him.", "end": 1324.06}, {"start": 1324.06, "text": "Hug, that's a hug.", "end": 1326.68}, {"start": 1326.68, "text": "The big hug his wife will give him.", "end": 1329.72}, {"start": 1329.72, "text": "他们结婚了。", "end": 1330.72}, {"start": 1330.72, "text": "Wife, 唯唯是girlfriend, will give him.", "end": 1334.28}, {"start": 1334.28, "text": "When she receives the gift.", "end": 1337.28}, {"start": 1337.28, "text": "When she gets the gift.", "end": 1339.28}, {"start": 1339.28, "text": "Receive就是get。", "end": 1340.28}, {"start": 1340.28, "text": "差在哪呢?", "end": 1342.28}, {"start": 1342.28, "text": "Receive很明确的是什么?", "end": 1343.28}, {"start": 1343.28, "text": "就是我重新干嘛。", "end": 1345.28}, {"start": 1345.28, "text": "获得。", "end": 1346.28}, {"start": 1346.28, "text": "Get是收获。", "end": 1347.28}, {"start": 1347.28, "text": "这个你们不用去区分。", "end": 1349.28}, {"start": 1349.28, "text": "你这里完全可以说get the gift.", "end": 1351.28}, {"start": 1351.28, "text": "His wife will give him when she gets the gift.", "end": 1355.97}, {"start": 1355.97, "text": "When he gives the gift to his wife at home.", "end": 1358.97}, {"start": 1358.97, "text": "She is very happy.", "end": 1361.97}, {"start": 1361.97, "text": "She hugs him tightly.", "end": 1363.97}, {"start": 1363.97, "text": "With a happy smile on her face.", "end": 1366.97}, {"start": 1366.97, "text": "She hugs him tightly.", "end": 1371.04}, {"start": 1371.04, "text": "Hug him tightly.", "end": 1374.04}, {"start": 1374.04, "text": "With a happy smile on her face.", "end": 1377.04}, {"start": 1377.04, "text": "Smile.", "end": 1379.92}, {"start": 1379.92, "text": "有些词我简化了。", "end": 1381.92}, {"start": 1381.92, "text": "但是对于有点水准。", "end": 1383.92}, {"start": 1383.92, "text": "包括学生这些。", "end": 1385.92}, {"start": 1385.92, "text": "这里面的词汇不算太难。", "end": 1387.92}, {"start": 1387.92, "text": "偶尔一两个,像extremely。", "end": 1389.92}, {"start": 1389.92, "text": "极限的是extreme。", "end": 1391.92}, {"start": 1391.92, "text": "这些你们有机的去吸收。", "end": 1393.92}, {"start": 1393.92, "text": "包括atmosphere。", "end": 1395.92}, {"start": 1395.92, "text": "这些属于比较高难度的英语词汇。", "end": 1397.92}, {"start": 1397.92, "text": "像高中水平。", "end": 1398.92}, {"start": 1398.92, "text": "这故事不复杂。", "end": 1400.92}, {"start": 1400.92, "text": "完全可以用已经学会的英语去说一遍。", "end": 1403.92}, {"start": 1403.92, "text": "你们没有必要去把完整版去背诵还是复述。", "end": 1407.92}, {"start": 1407.92, "text": "你们已经学过的语言。", "end": 1409.92}, {"start": 1409.92, "text": "足以去描述这个事情。", "end": 1411.92}, {"start": 1411.92, "text": "里面一两个词。", "end": 1412.92}, {"start": 1412.92, "text": "像jewelry。", "end": 1413.92}, {"start": 1413.92, "text": "necklace。", "end": 1414.92}, {"start": 1414.92, "text": "jewelry。", "end": 1415.92}, {"start": 1415.92, "text": "各种手势叫jewelry。", "end": 1417.92}, {"start": 1417.92, "text": "necklace。", "end": 1418.92}, {"start": 1418.92, "text": "戴在脖子上的这个链。", "end": 1420.92}, {"start": 1420.92, "text": "necklace。", "end": 1421.92}, {"start": 1421.92, "text": "这一两个词你可以有机的去吸收。", "end": 1424.92}, {"start": 1424.92, "text": "但大体上。", "end": 1425.92}, {"start": 1425.92, "text": "这里已经没有再超过你们现在的水准了。", "end": 1428.92}, {"start": 1428.92, "text": "所以我还是鼓励一下大家。", "end": 1430.92}, {"start": 1430.92, "text": "用你能用的英语。", "end": 1431.92}, {"start": 1431.92, "text": "去描述事情。", "end": 1433.92}, {"start": 1435.92, "text": "接下去的实节课。", "end": 1438.42}, {"start": 1438.42, "text": "综合运用的比重会大大提高。", "end": 1440.42}, {"start": 1440.42, "text": "但是不会超出我们已经学过的东西。", "end": 1443.42}, {"start": 1443.42, "text": "所以。", "end": 1444.42}, {"start": 1444.42, "text": "I will see you.", "end": 1445.42}, {"start": 1445.42, "text": "I will see you.", "end": 1447.42}, {"start": 1447.42, "text": "in lesson 21。", "end": 1449.42}]}